  "body": "• Elevated \"treehouse\" setting surrounded by established native bush\r\n• Stunning views stretching the length of Orewa Beach\r\n• Three bedrooms, two bathrooms, including a master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Two separate living areas and a separate laundry for added practicality\r\n• Cedar construction with the care and attention to detail of the current owners evident throughout\r\n• Generous 1,120sqm (more or less) section with private rear garden\r\n• Potential for minor dwelling, subject to council consent\r\n\r\nTucked amongst the treetops and surrounded by native bush, this unique coastal retreat offers a lifestyle that feels a world away from the everyday. Set on a substantial 1,120sqm (more or less) site, this is a home where nature, privacy and spectacular views come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the northern end of Orewa, the outlook is simply breathtaking. From your elevated position, look down the golden sweep of Orewa Beach, watch the ever-changing ocean beyond, and enjoy the tranquil backdrop of Eaves Bush and its magnificent native forest.\r\n\r\nConstructed in cedar, the home has been thoughtfully maintained and reflects the care and attention to detail of the current owners. Inside, the home has been designed to embrace its stunning surroundings. Three bedrooms and two bathrooms provide comfortable accommodation, including a generous master retreat complete with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe plus a private balcony to take in the views.\r\n\r\nThree separate living areas offer flexibility for families, guests, or those seeking space to relax and unwind, while a separate laundry adds everyday convenience. Large windows and generous decking create a seamless connection between indoors and out, ensuring the views are never far from sight.\r\n\r\nThe front deck is the hero of the home, offering the perfect vantage point to check the surf, soak up the sunshine, or entertain family and friends against a spectacular coastal backdrop. At the rear, a private garden sanctuary provides a sheltered space to relax amongst the greenery.\r\n\r\nThis is a location that truly captures the best of coastal living. Watch the waves from home, grab your board and be on the sand within minutes. Enjoy the peace and privacy of your bush-clad setting, while still being within easy reach of Orewa's vibrant cafés, shops and amenities.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a home that feels more like a private escape than a suburban address. Welcome to your very own treehouse by the ocean.\r\n\r\nAccess to the property is via a series of steps. Buyers are encouraged to consider this when viewing the home.",
